# --- Pipeline intermediates specific to this project ---
# Body-only LaTeX fragments produced by `pandoc -f markdown -t latex`
# (step 1 of the md -> tex -> pdf process). Fully reproducible from the
# approved *_Prova_<variant>.md source plus MCQ_template.tex, so there's
# no reason to track them.
*_corpo.tex

